111
00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:53.704 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你到底是怎么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:06:53.788 --> 00:06:56.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看到这张画就明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:06:56.332 --> 00:07:00.753 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长身边的是小时候的你和我</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:00.837 --> 00:07:03.756 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这张画不可能是别人画的</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:07.051 --> 00:07:08.010 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:08.094 --> 00:07:12.265 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>画师月冈津南也是赤报队的幸存者啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:12.348 --> 00:07:14.684 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回去吧 薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:20.440 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看阿左有些异样我们才跟来的
不过现在应该没事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:20.523 --> 00:07:24.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他现在还背着恶一字</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:07:24.735 --> 00:07:27.447 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队的经历对阿左来说
是特别的回忆</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:07:28.197 --> 00:07:31.993 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回忆的世界里就不需要外人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:07:40.585 --> 00:07:44.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到你竟然成了画师啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:07:44.505 --> 00:07:47.633 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是啊 小时候你就很灵巧</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:07:47.717 --> 00:07:53.514 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很难用的火炮跟火药的配制
都能信手拈来</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:07:53.598 --> 00:07:55.766 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 你现在做什么呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:07:56.851 --> 00:07:59.562 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没做什么 就是到处闲逛</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:07:59.645 --> 00:08:01.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过也很快活</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:04.358 --> 00:08:05.443 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:06.903 --> 00:08:08.905 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你过得很快活啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:15.536 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这十年来 我一次都没感到快活</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.288 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年来 我一直痛恨着那些</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:17.371 --> 00:08:22.752 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给相乐队长和赤报队伙伴
扣上污名的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:24.378 --> 00:08:28.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的性格变得比十年前还要阴暗了</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:28.883 --> 00:08:31.344 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是到现在也没交到一个朋友？</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:36.432 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 我十分理解你的心情</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.271 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到 在我准备好一切的这天</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:44.774 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然会跟你重逢</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:08:44.857 --> 00:08:50.696 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许是天上的队长在指引我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:52.198 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:08:52.281 --> 00:08:53.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:08:53.449 --> 00:08:56.869 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不要和我再一次组建赤报队？</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:08:58.329 --> 00:09:01.958 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一起推翻维新政府</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:02.625 --> 00:09:08.172 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>把相乐队长梦想中的新时代变为现实</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:15.096 --> 00:09:16.097 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.474 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你到底计划了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:18.558 --> 00:09:20.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你问计划了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:20.768 --> 00:09:23.354 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队的目标只有一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:23.437 --> 00:09:27.316 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就是队长一直梦想的
真正四民平等的新时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>推翻碍事的明治政府</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:36.784 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你难道光顾着画锦绘
没听说过西南战争吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:36.867 --> 00:09:41.038 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>西乡隆盛是在日本边缘的鹿儿岛举兵</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:41.122 --> 00:09:44.625 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那里怎么打最终都是徒劳</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:09:44.709 --> 00:09:47.878 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而我的目标是日本的中心</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:50.673 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是这东京</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:09:50.756 --> 00:09:55.386 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“内务省”统辖一切内政</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:09:55.469 --> 00:09:58.431 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一步就是要让它完全瘫痪</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:09:58.514 --> 00:10:00.099 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也想同时击溃陆海军省和财政部</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:00.182 --> 00:10:04.186 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我一个人是做不到的</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.354 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:05.438 --> 00:10:07.607 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不相信外人</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:10.484 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有的计划我会一个人实施</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:10.568 --> 00:10:13.863 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我是一个人 但是我有这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:14.697 --> 00:10:16.490 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:20.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>凭借在赤报队学到的火药兵器知识</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:20.578 --> 00:10:22.705 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我做出了这些炸弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:22.788 --> 00:10:27.585 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我谨慎地避人耳目
花了十年做出的自信作品</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:27.668 --> 00:10:32.173 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>爆炸之后会起火
也能起到燃烧弹的作用</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:32.256 --> 00:10:36.719 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用炸弹逐个爆破各个省厅
就能削弱中央的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:36.802 --> 00:10:40.222 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>全国各地
心存不满的士族和农民就会一起发难</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:10:40.306 --> 00:10:42.767 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武装起义一触即发</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:47.355 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>西南战争的消耗
让政府前所未有的虚弱</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:10:47.438 --> 00:10:50.483 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来只剩下等待雪崩般的溃败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:10:50.566 --> 00:10:52.234 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:10:52.318 --> 00:10:55.071 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个真正的四民平等的时代将来临</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:10:55.154 --> 00:10:57.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终洗刷队长和赤报队的污名</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:10:59.367 --> 00:11:01.327 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>行动就在明天</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:04.038 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>人手最少的周日晚上</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:04.997 --> 00:11:08.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 我不想强迫你加入</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:08.084 --> 00:11:12.922 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但作为原赤报队成员
我即使一个人也要行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:13.672 --> 00:11:16.467 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明晚之前好好想想 给我答复</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:23.432 --> 00:11:24.642 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:24.725 --> 00:11:28.396 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>西南战争对明治政府造成的损耗再大</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:28.479 --> 00:11:33.484 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点炸弹和零散的起义
也无法撼动它的统治</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:34.068 --> 00:11:35.736 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年间 他一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:39.824 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只想着洗刷赤报队和队长的污名</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:39.907 --> 00:11:41.951 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本看不到现在</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:49.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:11:51.127 --> 00:11:52.294 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:11:53.421 --> 00:11:55.423 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明已经是春天了</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:11:56.006 --> 00:11:58.509 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>风还是这么冷</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:06.183 --> 00:12:07.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左？</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.110 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:22.158 --> 00:12:23.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 修好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:24.785 --> 00:12:27.496 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你看
-谢谢队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.583 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用枪的时候叫上别的队员</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:30.666 --> 00:12:32.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别一个人乱来</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:33.794 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:33.878 --> 00:12:39.258 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过枪管歪成这样
还有这么高的命中率 很了不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:39.341 --> 00:12:45.014 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不擅长用刀剑或者近战
所以至少想用好枪…</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:45.097 --> 00:12:46.432 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可靠啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:47.099 --> 00:12:49.727 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过并不需要这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:53.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩 你们应该努力学习</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:53.814 --> 00:12:55.858 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>学习？</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:55.941 --> 00:12:58.611 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀剑火炮的时代就快要结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:58.694 --> 00:13:02.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>之后就是知识与智慧的时代了</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.075 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是属于你们的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:05.826 --> 00:13:08.496 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去认识不同的人 增长见识</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:08.579 --> 00:13:11.499 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我让你们跟着我就是为了这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:11.582 --> 00:13:14.210 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是我们想要保护队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:18.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不想让你们做我的盾</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:18.506 --> 00:13:20.090 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:20.174 --> 00:13:22.426 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要和左之助要互相保护</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>互相支撑走向未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:25.554 --> 00:13:28.307 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>随着时代变化 赤报队也会发生改变</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>新的赤报队要由你们来创造</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:32.895 --> 00:13:34.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在也许对你们来说很难理解</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:35.856 --> 00:13:39.193 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但总有一天你会明白我的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:41.529 --> 00:13:42.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:42.905 --> 00:13:48.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没能保护你 也没能适应新的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:49.578 --> 00:13:52.540 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但请在天上见证 队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:52.623 --> 00:13:56.669 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我为之奋斗十年的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:56.752 --> 00:13:59.255 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我创造的新赤报队</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:01.715 --> 00:14:02.800 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:02.883 --> 00:14:06.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说月冈津南是你的老朋友？</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:06.637 --> 00:14:09.265 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你听起来好像并不惊讶啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:09.348 --> 00:14:12.351 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然惊讶啦 是不是啊 薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:12.434 --> 00:14:14.019 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:14.103 --> 00:14:15.980 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:16.063 --> 00:14:19.608 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之我们准备开个重逢宴会庆祝一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:19.692 --> 00:14:22.862 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你介意今晚借用一下道场吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:22.945 --> 00:14:27.616 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我倒是不介意 但是你哪来的钱呢…</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你别想再让我给你付账了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:30.578 --> 00:14:32.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不行 绝对不行！</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:32.496 --> 00:14:35.541 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说 不用担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:35.624 --> 00:14:37.251 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>钱的事交给我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:37.334 --> 00:14:39.879 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就拜托你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:39.962 --> 00:14:43.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对啦 把阿妙和小姑娘也叫上</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:43.924 --> 00:14:46.343 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她们应该会很开心</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:50.389 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:50.472 --> 00:14:51.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好奇怪 太奇怪了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:51.724 --> 00:14:54.268 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助是不是生什么病了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:55.519 --> 00:14:57.146 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静点</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:57.229 --> 00:14:59.106 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>春天来了啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:13.954 --> 00:15:16.415 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我们开始吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:16.498 --> 00:15:19.793 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么啊 你说钱的事交给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:19.877 --> 00:15:22.796 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来就是让津南先生出钱啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:25.341 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:25.424 --> 00:15:26.508 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:26.592 --> 00:15:30.512 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思 我们可以一起吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:30.596 --> 00:15:32.348 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:32.431 --> 00:15:35.309 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么说的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:37.728 --> 00:15:39.229 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:39.313 --> 00:15:41.649 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起…我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:41.732 --> 00:15:44.610 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经过去了 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:44.693 --> 00:15:47.655 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果阿左先生不介意 我们也没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:47.738 --> 00:15:49.573 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:50.491 --> 00:15:51.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:51.825 --> 00:15:56.330 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>宵太喜欢赌博
喜欢小孩子们和女性的笑容</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:56.413 --> 00:15:59.583 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有兴趣的话 去他墓前看看吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:59.667 --> 00:16:01.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她已经去过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:01.418 --> 00:16:02.586 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:03.921 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:09.051 --> 00:16:11.804 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生 这到底是什么宴会？</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:11.887 --> 00:16:14.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你请客还是第一回啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:15.182 --> 00:16:17.226 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种小事不要在意</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:17.309 --> 00:16:20.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我们不醉不归！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:34.368 --> 00:16:39.123 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到津南和阿左先生是发小啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:39.206 --> 00:16:42.501 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生小时候什么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:42.584 --> 00:16:44.003 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:44.086 --> 00:16:46.088 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:46.755 --> 00:16:48.007 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没怎么变</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:52.511 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>总是那么冒失
不会想那么多 跟着直觉走</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:52.594 --> 00:16:54.888 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 真像他啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:54.972 --> 00:16:59.059 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像一旦爆炸就无法阻止的炸弹一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:59.143 --> 00:17:00.728 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 果然啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:00.811 --> 00:17:02.813 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想让我勒死你吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:02.896 --> 00:17:04.106 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:04.606 --> 00:17:08.527 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>关键时刻他也很靠得住</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.120 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:18.203 --> 00:17:19.955 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会当作家宝珍藏的</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:21.248 --> 00:17:22.916 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.334 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用谢我</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:24.418 --> 00:17:26.420 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让他给你画张像吧 阿左先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:26.503 --> 00:17:27.546 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就不用了</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:27.629 --> 00:17:30.049 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是小屁孩的时候
他已经画了很多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:30.132 --> 00:17:33.969 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他总是画我鼻青脸肿
满身伤疤的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:34.053 --> 00:17:35.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真丢人</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:35.345 --> 00:17:38.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只是如实画罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:38.724 --> 00:17:40.476 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真像阿左先生啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:40.559 --> 00:17:42.770 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那画绯村先生呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:44.146 --> 00:17:45.481 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就不用了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:45.564 --> 00:17:47.608 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么关系啊？就让他画一张</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:47.691 --> 00:17:49.568 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就当酒席上的小游戏啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:53.906 --> 00:17:55.949 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你和左之助是什么关系？</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:56.575 --> 00:17:58.077 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>朋友</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.454 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为一点争斗认识的</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:00.537 --> 00:18:02.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说你是个浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:03.415 --> 00:18:04.583 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以前是做什么的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:05.667 --> 00:18:07.336 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下当时在西边</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:09.004 --> 00:18:10.047 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>京都？</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:13.926 --> 00:18:16.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:19.181 --> 00:18:20.557 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:20.641 --> 00:18:22.768 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正是</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:25.646 --> 00:18:26.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:27.564 --> 00:18:30.901 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我第一次给维新志士画像</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:30.984 --> 00:18:32.736 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都是过去的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.905 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下现在只是一介浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:34.988 --> 00:18:36.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:38.826 --> 00:18:40.327 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>画好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 没有五官？</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:43.664 --> 00:18:46.083 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只画我看见的东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:46.166 --> 00:18:47.793 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看不清这个男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:47.876 --> 00:18:53.006 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看不清在他的笑容和伤疤后
究竟隐藏着什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:18:57.761 --> 00:19:01.890 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但有这个伤疤就可以认出是在下啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:06.645 --> 00:19:08.647 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生 多谢你请客</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.983 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次来我家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:11.066 --> 00:19:12.901 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 我会的</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:13.902 --> 00:19:15.237 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>路上小心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:15.946 --> 00:19:19.116 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>知道啦 那明天见 阿左先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:20.659 --> 00:19:22.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 明天见</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:33.964 --> 00:19:35.174 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:35.924 --> 00:19:37.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们差不多该出发了</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:37.968 --> 00:19:40.179 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后的晚餐</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:40.262 --> 00:19:42.389 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你吃得尽兴吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:42.472 --> 00:19:46.226 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>并没有
我不是抱着那种打算开的宴会</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:49.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>红牛的人和小姑娘她们
平时请我吃了很多饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:50.522 --> 00:19:52.691 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个算是还礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:52.774 --> 00:19:54.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>修和银次…</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:54.484 --> 00:19:56.445 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 只是顺便</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:56.528 --> 00:19:58.363 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:19:58.447 --> 00:20:00.032 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>玩得开心吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:01.074 --> 00:20:02.534 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>完全不开心</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:02.618 --> 00:20:03.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
